# Deep Analysis: AI Voice Assistant Platform

## What Is This Project?

This is a **full-stack, real-time AI Voice Assistant platform** — a production-grade system that enables **conversational AI** over **phone calls (Twilio)**, **web calls (LiveKit)**, **SMS**, and **chat (WebSocket)**. It acts like a smart customer-support agent for a **Shopify e-commerce store**, capable of answering product questions, looking up orders, cancelling orders, and routing responses across multiple communication channels simultaneously.

---

## High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Client (React + Vite)"
        UI["UnifiedAgent UI"]
        AudioComp["Audio Component"]
        ChatComp["Chat Component"]
        BulkCall["Bulk Call"]
    end

    subgraph "Node.js Server (server.js)"
        Express["Express API :5001"]
        WSVoice["WebSocket Voice :5002"]
        WSChat["WebSocket Chat :5003"]
        SessionMgr["Session Manager"]
        AIProc["AI Processing"]
        AudioUtils["Audio Utils"]
        OutputRouter["handleOutput Router"]
    end

    subgraph "External AI Services"
        Gemini["Google Gemini 2.5 Flash"]
        Deepgram["Deepgram Nova-3 STT"]
        DeepgramTTS["Deepgram Aura-2 TTS"]
        Polly["AWS Polly TTS"]
        Gabber["Gabber TTS"]
    end

    subgraph "Python Subsystem"
        VAD["Silero VAD (vad.py)"]
        TurnDetect["Turn Detector gRPC :50051"]
        SmolLM["SmolLM2-135M ONNX"]
    end

    subgraph "Telephony & Comms"
        Twilio["Twilio (Calls + SMS)"]
        LiveKit["LiveKit Server"]
    end

    subgraph "E-Commerce"
        Shopify["Shopify GraphQL API"]
    end

    UI --> Express
    AudioComp --> WSVoice
    AudioComp --> LiveKit
    ChatComp --> WSChat
    BulkCall --> Express

    Express --> SessionMgr
    WSVoice --> SessionMgr
    WSChat --> SessionMgr

    SessionMgr --> AIProc
    AIProc --> Gemini
    AIProc --> Shopify

    WSVoice -->|"raw audio"| FFmpeg["FFmpeg Resampler"]
    FFmpeg --> VAD
    VAD -->|"speech chunks"| Deepgram

    Deepgram -->|"transcript"| TurnDetect
    TurnDetect --> SmolLM
    TurnDetect -->|"end_of_turn"| AIProc

    AIProc -->|"response text"| OutputRouter
    OutputRouter -->|"audio"| Polly
    OutputRouter -->|"audio"| DeepgramTTS
    OutputRouter -->|"audio"| Gabber
    OutputRouter -->|"sms"| Twilio
    OutputRouter -->|"chat"| WSChat

    Polly --> AudioUtils
    AudioUtils --> LiveKit
    AudioUtils --> Twilio
```

