## Dynamic Prompt Engineering

The [setChannel()](file:///d:/work/ship-fast.studio/Ai-Assistant/server.js#1205-1289) function ([server.js:L1205](file:///d:/work/ship-fast.studio/Ai-Assistant/server.js#L1205-L1288)) dynamically **rebuilds the system prompt** whenever a new channel becomes available. The prompt tells the AI:
1. You can communicate via these channels: `[audio, chat, sms]`
2. Include user data (name, email, phone) for personalization
3. **Always respond as strict JSON**: `{"response": "...", "output_channel": "..."}`
4. Only hang up when explicitly asked

This is what makes the system truly multi-modal — the AI decides the best output channel per response.

