## Technology Stack Summary

| Layer | Technologies |
|-------|-------------|
| **Runtime** | Node.js (Express 5), Python 3 |
| **Frontend** | React 19, Vite, livekit-client, Lucide icons |
| **Real-time Audio** | LiveKit (WebRTC), WebSocket, FFmpeg |
| **STT** | Deepgram Nova-3 (streaming WebSocket) |
| **TTS** | AWS Polly, Deepgram Aura-2, Gabber |
| **LLM** | Google Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite (function calling) |
| **VAD** | Silero VAD (PyTorch, Python subprocess) |
| **Turn Detection** | SmolLM2-135M (ONNX quantized), gRPC |
| **Telephony** | Twilio (voice + SMS) |
| **E-Commerce** | Shopify Admin GraphQL API |
| **IPC** | gRPC (protobuf), stdin/stdout pipes, WebSocket |
